Tenet ports render_prompt_parts, render_prompt and label_mapping from
openjev_contracts.py to src/decision/apus-renderer.ts. It uses the no-thinking
CHAT constant from examples/openjev_local.py. Changes: TypeScript implementation,
canonical Tenet choice input, sorted state serialization and returned rendering
parts. There is no upstream Python execution or download in the product.

The native transport and validation are Tenet code. No model weights or inference
runtime are bundled. Backend aliases do not attest to a weight revision.

